  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "46f27b32-69a7-464f-a9a9-9171a58b63ff"],
 " subdivisions on its shortest polygon side. Each loop omits the repeated \
closing vertex."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1536416833,ExpressionUUID->"156b9613-3403-094f-8472-45895fd3f22a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The returned list of loops can be used for ",
